colored=\"1\"><span class=\"jv-type\">String</span></code></span></td><td>地图控件名称。</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"imapwidgetmanager_mapwidget_setname\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#imapwidgetmanager_mapwidget_setname_inline\">setName</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"imapwidgetmanager_mapwidget_setname_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>setName</h3><span class=\"ifm-badge ifm-since-badge\">Since MSDK 5.20.1</span></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">setName</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-type\">String</span> <span class=\"jv-param\">name</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span> </span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>包：</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.open.pilot.base.manager.map</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">设置地图控件名称。 <br><br> 业务标识用（如 “火点-A12”、“人员-张三”），不会展示在地图上。如需在地图上显示文字，请使用 MapMarkerOptions.setTitle(String)（marker 标题）或 MapWidgetItem.setTitle(String)（点击弹窗标题）。</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading\">参数</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table\"><thead><tr><th>名称</th><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>name</code></td><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><span class=\"jv-type\">String</span> </code></span></td><td>地图控件名称。</td></tr></tbody></table></font></d